WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.268
Hi there!

2
00:00:10.269 --> 00:00:13.045
Hi there!

3
00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.973
Who are you?

4
00:00:14.974 --> 00:00:18.786
I'm an ostrich.

5
00:00:18.787 --> 00:00:23.674
I'm the biggest bird in the world.

6
00:00:23.675 --> 00:00:26.071
Where do you live?

7
00:00:26.072 --> 00:00:29.658
We live in Africa.

8
00:00:29.659 --> 00:00:33.928
We like the savanna and the desert.

9
00:00:33.929 --> 00:00:36.721
Do you have wings?

10
00:00:36.722 --> 00:00:40.430
Yes. We have wings.

11
00:00:40.431 --> 00:00:44.130
But we can't fly.

12
00:00:44.131 --> 00:00:54.169
We can run very fast though.

13
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:56.949
Your legs look strong.

14
00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:01.101
Ostriches' legs are very strong.

15
00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:04.636
We can kick enemies with them.

16
00:01:04.637 --> 00:01:09.545
Our feet have sharp claws.

17
00:01:09.546 --> 00:01:12.959
What do you eat?

18
00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:16.041
We eat plants.

19
00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:19.426
We get water from them too.

20
00:01:19.427 --> 00:01:24.633
Sometimes we eat bugs or lizards.

21
00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:27.760
Do you live in a herd?

22
00:01:27.761 --> 00:01:30.297
Yes.

23
00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:34.495
One male ostrich is in charge.

24
00:01:34.496 --> 00:01:39.176
Females put all their eggs together.

25
00:01:39.177 --> 00:01:43.773
Do ostriches stick their heads in the ground?

26
00:01:43.774 --> 00:01:46.423
No.

27
00:01:46.424 --> 00:01:50.540
We just put our heads near the ground.

28
00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:55.407
That helps us hide from enemies.

29
00:01:55.408 --> 00:01:58.277
Oh, I see a lion!

30
00:01:58.278 --> 00:02:00.885
See you later.

31
00:02:00.886 --> 00:02:05.643
Bye, Ostrich!
